Package: com.sa1nt.audiocurve
Name: AudioCurve
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: System wide 3 band equalizer with an AirPods style Custom EQ screen. Filters the mixed output inside mediaserverd, so Music, Spotify, YouTube, Safari and games are all affected.
